            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe 'mini.trailspace' module is kept as minimal as possible by design. You can achieve the behavior you describe with the following mapping: `vim.keymap.set('x', '<Leader>w', [[:s/\\s\\+$//<CR>]])`\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
