            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "https://github.com/mcauley-penney/tidy.nvim -- supports \"only modified lines\" \"on save\"\n\nhttps://github.com/thirtythreeforty/lessspace.vim -- dynamic editing\n```\n    -- By default, LessSpace strips whitespace after normal mode operations\n    -- This is annoying, eg if pressing `D`: all indents disappear\n    -- Have LessSpace only work in insert mode by setting g:lessspace_normal=0\n    vim.g.lessspace_normal = 1\n```",
